  "definition_ja": "記号 =。その左右の数や式が等しいことを表す。",
  "definition_en": "The symbol =, which shows that the expressions on its two sides have the same value.",
  "latex": "a = b",
  "spoken_en": "a equals b",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "The equal sign means both sides have the same value, not 'write your answer here.'",
      "ja": "等号は、両側が同じ値だという意味。「ここに答えを書く」という意味じゃないよ。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Fill in the blank so that the equal sign makes a true statement: 8 + 5 = ___ + 6.",
      "ja": "等号の左右が等しくなるように、□ に当てはまる数を求めよ。8 + 5 = □ + 6",
      "register": "written"
    }
  ],
  "collocations": [],
  "pitfalls": [
    "= は equals または is equal to と読む。3 + 4 = 7 は three plus four equals seven。",
    "「等号が成り立つ」（不等式 A ≧ B で A = B となる）は equality holds と言う（エントリ equality-holds）。"
